Fifth grade, I was in Ms. Hobbs class.

00:39:39.903 --> 00:39:40.736
Hobbs, Ms. Hobbs.

00:39:40.736 --> 00:39:42.329
I couldn't remember if you were in there.

00:39:42.329 --> 00:39:43.317
Yeah.

