00:39:54.218 --> 00:39:55.183
We haven't given the update,

00:39:55.183 --> 00:39:56.815
I not gonna do it now
but just as a reminder

00:39:56.815 --> 00:39:59.966
we haven't given the update
about what we learned about...

00:39:59.966 --> 00:40:04.536
We met someone who knew
about the posters contest.

00:40:04.536 --> 00:40:06.625
I need to get the full
story and report back.

00:40:06.625 --> 00:40:07.458
From Cole.

00:40:07.458 --> 00:40:08.601
Yeah, from my brother.
Your brother.

00:40:08.601 --> 00:40:10.208
My brother met someone who was in charge

00:40:10.208 --> 00:40:12.495
of choosing the winner of that contest.

00:40:12.495 --> 00:40:13.721
The other thing I remember...

00:40:13.721 --> 00:40:14.554
Oh, wow.

00:40:14.554 --> 00:40:15.709
The other thing I remember from Ms. Hobbs

00:40:15.709 --> 00:40:17.962
